  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must have at least one tempered ur-stone worn against your skin</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You throw a bolt of Jade energy to knock an enemy away from you.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong> and make a <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> opposed by the target's <strong>Resilience</strong>.</p><p>If the target fails, it is pushed <strong>1 + ES</strong> spaces away from you, where <strong>ES</strong> is the difference between your successes and those of the target creature.</p><p>Additionally, you may use this ability to break objects at a range, such as doors, windows, or barricades.</p>",
